Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_as.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     val x = as Float;
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name @= value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name @= value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0030]: Jet doesn't use `as` for conversions
  --> tests/ui/foreign_as.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     val x = as Float;
    |             ^^
 Why: convert with methods like `.to_float()` or `.to_string()`
 Fix: e.g. `x.to_float()` instead of `x as Float`
